 369:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Hssl/Hssl/IfxHssl_Hssl.h ****  * choose what flags needs to be enabled for HSCT interrupt and call the following function once fo
 370:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Hssl/Hssl/IfxHssl_Hssl.h ****  * and after choosing all the flags needed, enable the HSCT interrupt with desired type of service 
