 389:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Hssl/Hssl/IfxHssl_Hssl.h ****  * choose what flags needs to be enabled for HSSL global error (EXI) interrupt and call the followi
 390:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Hssl/Hssl/IfxHssl_Hssl.h ****  * and after choosing all the flags needed, enable the HSSL EXI interrupt with desired type of serv
 391:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Hssl/Hssl/IfxHssl_Hssl.h ****  *
 392:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Hssl/Hssl/IfxHssl_Hssl.h ****  * \code
 393:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Hssl/Hssl/IfxHssl_Hssl.h ****  *     Ifx_HSSL *hssl = &MODULE_HSSL;
